  "_cells_removed": "No custom cell — we place into the VANILLA Whiterun Bannered Mare (Skyrim.esm:0x01605E) so `coc WhiterunBanneredMare` is guaranteed to teleport (vanilla cell + real floor + lighting). The two floor coords below (-119,-504,68 / -49,-504,68) are from the shipped interior_spec.json example, confirmed-open floor.",

